  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Morocco Earthquake 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An earthquake measuring 6.8 magnitude struck Morocco at approximately 23:00 on Friday 8th September 2023. The epicentre was located in the High Atlas Mountains, around 71km south-west of Marrakech at a depth of 18.5km. The earthquake was felt in Algeria and the Canary Islands.</narrative>
  </description>
